 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Stir until the salt and sugar dissolve:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>water <span class=\"amt\">600 ml</span></li><li>coarse (kosher) salt <span class=\"amt\">50 ml</span></li><li>sugar <span class=\"amt\">3 tbsp</span></li></ul></li><li>Peel the radish and cut it into <b>3 cm cubes</b>.</li><li>Leave the cubes in the brine for <b>around 5 hours</b>, then tip them into a colander.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
