    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Grate the garlic, ginger and pear on the ceramic grater (or a fine metal one).</li><li>Squeeze the grated pear and the grated ginger through cheesecloth — the juice is what you want.</li><li>Mix into a thick red paste:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>crushed garlic <span class=\"amt\">2 tbsp</span></li><li>ginger juice <span class=\"amt\">2 tsp</span></li><li>salted anchovy sauce (or fish sauce) <span class=\"amt\">4 tbsp</span></li><li>Korean chili powder (gochugaru) <span class=\"amt\">5 tbsp</span></li><li>pear juice <span class=\"amt\">4 tbsp</span></li><li>salted shrimp sauce, chopped (or fish sauce) <span class=\"amt\">1 tbsp</span></li><li>kelp (kombu) stock <span class=\"amt\">4 tbsp</span></li></ul></li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-3",
