   "title": "Make the filling",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Tip the drained cubes into the paste with the green onions and toss until each cube is red all over.</li><li>Gloves help — the chili stains.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-4",
